OL,3,GNEWSAMaternity unit fears prompt call
OL,4,Afor guarantee
OL,5,
OL,6,FJess Bailey, chair of Devon County
OL,7,FCouncil's health scrutiny committee,
OL,8,Fsaid she was "appalled that closing
OL,9,Fsmaller units including Barnstaple is
OL,10,Fnow on the agenda".
OL,12,FThe Department of Health and Social
OL,13,FCare has been approached for comment.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
